[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11582.55, "timestamp": "03:13:02", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。很多东西。音乐盒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11584.71, "timestamp": "03:13:04", "text": "也一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11590.27, "timestamp": "03:13:10", "text": "这是什么？哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11592.15, "timestamp": "03:13:12", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11594.07, "timestamp": "03:13:14", "text": "我想那就是那里，是的，她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11595.99, "timestamp": "03:13:15", "text": "开采。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11599.59, "timestamp": "03:13:19", "text": "对，为了钻石之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11602.15, "timestamp": "03:13:22", "text": "没什么好看的。我们上去吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11604.55, "timestamp": "03:13:24", "text": "是的，我记得我帮过她，她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11606.95, "timestamp": "03:13:26", "text": "被苦力怕杀死了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11609.91, "timestamp": "03:13:29", "text": "哦，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11618.2, "timestamp": "03:13:38", "text": "但这真是满满的怀旧之情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11621.19, "timestamp": "03:13:41", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11628.71, "timestamp": "03:13:48", "text": "好的，我们可以上去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11631.75, "timestamp": "03:13:51", "text": "哦，它上去了。是的，这很重要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11634.309, "timestamp": "03:13:54", "text": "你知道，就是那种豪宅。这真是太开放了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11636.87, "timestamp": "03:13:56", "text": "地方。我记得我被苦力怕杀死过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11639.67, "timestamp": "03:13:59", "text": "这里是因为没有火把。愿她安息"}]